# icons/ is immutable

Do not add, modify, rename, or delete any file under `icons/`.

Those SVGs are used exactly as vendored (see `icons/readme.md`). Android
drawables may be converted under `android/app/src/main/res/drawable/` only;
never edit the source files in `icons/` to match drawables.
